            "Yes, because the manufacturer failed to obtain an equitable decree of cancellation before the retraction was communicated.",
            "No, because the manufacturer materially changed its position by entering into a binding cover contract with a competitor before the retraction was made.",
            "No, because an anticipatory repudiation of a contract containing a 'time is of the essence' clause cannot be retracted under any circumstances."
